  "caveat": "All three arms are page-cache warm after the first pass; the point is the ordering across mechanisms under one identical workload, not cold-storage throughput. The passthrough arm is a read-only snapshot, so the sequential-append workload has no passthrough row by construction. Single run, single host.",
